# Routine "Team celebrations reminder": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Friday morning, the birthdays and work anniversaries landing in the next 14 days.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/office-ops-desk && pi -p "/team-celebrations-reminder"
